travel agents and tour operators may be allowed against an Authorisation, based on
recommendation of Director General, Tourism, Government of India.', 'Indha Import of Restricted items required by Hotels, Restaurants, Travel section-la, 2.49 import of Restricted items required by Hotels, Restaurants, Travel
