(c)
Statement giving details of shipping bills / invoice against which FIRC was
issued.', 'Direct negotiation of export documents governs how DGFT business controls should be applied, validated, and enforced.', 'Direct negotiation of export documents explains the operating rule set that DEKAI should enforce. Key control points include 2.67 Direct negotiation of export documents
